docs {
  # Reading sessions

  A reading session is one distinct reading of a book. Rereading starts a new session; earlier
  sessions are never overwritten. A book's reading status (`unread`, `reading`, `completed`) is
  derived from its sessions by **Reading overview**; books never store it.

  Run the folder in order. **Register reading reader** creates its own disposable account and the
  folder creates its own book, so it is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Reading sessions").
}
